Restore the old safe ConLeche.withPtrEq (deprecated and made unsafe upstream in Lean on 2026-09-21)
as ConLeche/Util/PtrEq.lean, and use it at the three call sites; withPtrEqDecEq's new signature
in Kernel/PtrDecEq.lean (ConLeche.ptrDecEq, since con-leche #578 the one caller of withPtrEqDecEq). Toolchain nightly-2026-10-20 (vendor/README.md, "Toolchain switch" 1).

